- **“Treat all employees fairly and consistently, applying policies based on role, performance, and conduct.”**
- **“Apply workplace rules uniformly regardless of personal beliefs or background.”**
- **“Ensure managers make decisions based on job-related criteria and objective evaluations.”**

If you tell me what the underlying business goal is (e.g., training, accommodation, scheduling, performance management), I can help you phrase it appropriately."
